  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "49",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 49"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "49",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu yitutu, ntiyililenu. Enu nyuza yawantu, tiyenu oku kwakulehikumudi. Yehova wantambikili hohinafumini mwivumu, ijinadami waditeneni hohinavwalikili mwivumu damama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanwa kamiwakela dehi neyi mpoku yakabali yatwa, nansweki muwulelu wachikasachindi; naŋili dehi hinidi iteti dabebema, nanhembi chachiwahi mumungonguwindi wansewu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wapilili nindi, Yeyi kambuyami, yeyi Isarela mwakamwekena lubanji lwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nami, Nakabakani tuhu, nakisaŋa anituhu Ŋovu jami chakadi niniyi yinukumwenamu, mwamukunkulwayi tuhu; hela chochu, kunsompela chidi kudi Yehova, wuloku wami wudi kudi Nzambi yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu Yehova wanwumbili mwivumu damama kulonda niikali kambuŋindi, nakaleti cheŋi Yakoba kudi yena, nakapompeshi cheŋi aIsarela kudi yena; muloŋa ami nalema kumesu aYehova, Nzambi yami nekali dehi Ŋovu yami nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Eyi kwikala kambuŋa ami wakusaŋumuna cheŋi nyuza yaYakoba, wakufuntisha cheŋi aIsarela ahembewa, chaswayi, nukukuhana wikali chejeji chawajentili kulondawakekali wamwinu wami ndo nikwakumina maseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nkúuli yaIsarela, Windi Wajila, hakumwila adiwulawu kudi antu, ahelawu kudi muza, kambuŋa awanyuli, nindi, Anyanta akamona, akanyamuka heseki; niatulamba nawa, akadifukula; hansaŋu yaYehova washinshika, yowu Wajila waIsarela nakutondi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Nakwakuli hampinji yayiwahi, nakukwashi mwifuku dawamwinu. Nukukuhembaŋa, nukukuhana wikali wachitiyaŋe nuchawantu ami, wusaŋumuni ituŋa, wuyiswanishi mawuswana ela dehi mahembi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakayilaŋa akasawu neyi, Idikenu, wakayili adi mumwidimaneyi, Dimwekeshenu. Akadiilaŋa mumajila, akadya matahu awu hayilundalunda yankumbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakatiya hela nzala hela mpwilaku. Hiyakayetahela kudi nkanza hela kudi itaŋwaku. Muloŋa wayitiyilaŋa wushonawakayi twamininaŋa, wakayilombolaŋa kutuseloki twameji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpidi jami jejima nakajibalumuna kwikala njila yakuhitila, nyikwakwa yami nakayilundwisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, awa akafuma kwakulehi. Tiyenu, awa akafuma kukabeta kakuchimunswa nikumujika. Awa akafuma kwituŋa daSinimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mawulu, imbenu tumina. Enu maseki, zaŋa ajalenu. Enu mapidi, vwakukenu kwimba tumina. Muloŋa Yehova nakundeji dehi antu indi, indi amona ihuŋu wakayitiyila wushona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchinka Ziyona nindi, Yehova naŋumbi dehi kwindi, Yehova nanhumbuli dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumbanda ahumbuli mwanindi wuchidi kwamwa? Abuli kutiyila mwanindi wakudivwela wushona? Eŋa, awa kwiji akuhumbula, hakwila ami hinakakuhumbulaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, nakuchaati dehi mumakasami, mpwembu jeyi najitalaŋa ho-o mafuku onsu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyaneyi hiyakunyakala. Akwakukukisaŋa ana, adiŋa nakukunopesha, akafuma mudeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fumbulakumesu eyi wutali niniku niniku. Awa ejima hiyakudipompesha, hiyakwinza kudeyi. Yehova nindi, Ichi nahandichi kwaamu, chalala kwaamu, wejimawawu wakayivwala neyi chuma chakudiwahisha nachu, wakadivwikawu neyinsumbuki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumahembeyi kwakisika dehi, nimwituŋa deyi mwanoŋeshawu dehi, chalala mwakayikehela antu akashakamamu, niantu akuminyinaŋa akekala kwakulehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tushala tweyi amba kahosha kumatu eyi nawu, Idi iluŋa adinatukeheli, twinki chipela chakutuŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiwakahosha mumuchimaweyi neyi, Nanvweleli wenawa hinyi? Ami anyanami ejima afwili dehito-o, nashala wunka, nakinjikewa, nakimbukaŋa niniku niniku. Indinaleli tvenawa hinyi? Ami nasheli kanka wami, indi awa, adiŋi kudihi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Nzambi nahoshi nindi, Tiya, nyuza nukuyinyamwina chikasachami, nyuza yawantu nukuyimikila mpandelu yami. Anyaneyi amayala akayileta akukumbata hantulu jawu, anyaneyi awambanda akayeleka hamafwiji awu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyanta ankanu diwu akekalaŋa atata jenu akuyilela, anyadŋawu diwu akekalaŋa amama jenu akuyilela. Akakubanda mina chamesu awu heseki, akalasha lunkuŋu lwakunyendu yeyi. Hiwakeluka neyi yami Yehova, neyi anchiŋililaŋami hiyakatiya nsonyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chilobu amwamuki chuma chakwatayi dehi? Ankoli jamu kwakuloŋa aapuluki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Yehova nindi, Ankoli jachilobu akayifumishaku, chakwa Tatawudehi kudi muntu atiyawu woma chakapuluka. Muloŋa muntuwukulwa naneyi, ami nami nakalwa nindi, anyaneyi nakayamwina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awaakukabishaŋa eyi nakayidiisha mbiji yawu awenawu, akasheta mashi awu awenawu neyi chakusheta vinyu yatowala. Niantu ejima akeluka nawuami Yehova, yami chamwinu cheyi, yami nkúuli yeyi, yami Mukwaŋovu waYakoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
